Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssh-client, ca-certificates, systemd, tzdata
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ancientswede/Huginn
Description: attacker intelligence and blocklists from your own honeypot
 Huginn pulls the logs from a Cowrie honeypot on an isolated machine and shows
 who attacks it, what they try and which files they drop, with a page per
 attacker, campaigns and firewall blocklists.
 .
 After installing, run huginn-setup to connect it to your honeypot.
